      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Two Vidu S2-Avatar characters in conversation: Tom, a fisherman out in a storm, and his daughter Maya in her greenhouse. Each turn is its own one-segment sequence and Reactor Render, and Concatenate Video joins the turns in order, so every cut lands where a reply begins and ends.\n\nEach character hears the line on its segment, not the other's actual reply: a render outputs video only, so the script says what was just said. Leave greeting empty so each turn starts on the answer. Each turn is its own call, so the characters don't remember earlier turns.\n\nCopy example_inputs/ into ComfyUI's input folder first, and set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Two Vidu S2-Avatar characters in conversation: Tom, a fisherman out in a storm, and his daughter Maya in her greenhouse. Each turn is its own one-segment sequence and Reactor Render, and Concatenate Video joins the turns in order, so every cut lands where a reply begins and ends.\n\nEach character hears the line on its segment, not the other's actual reply: a render outputs video only, so the script says what was just said. Leave greeting empty so each turn starts on the answer. Each turn is its own call, so the characters don't remember earlier turns.\n\nCopy example_inputs/ into ComfyUI's input folder first, and set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
